{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:31:11+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Big Cat Jigsaw Quest", "steam_appid": 3396280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3398910, 3402780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour the pieces out of the box, find the corners and watch a tiger in the snow or a black-maned lion on the savanna come together piece by piece. <strong>Big Cat Jigsaw Quest</strong> is a calm, good-looking jigsaw puzzle game about lions and tigers, with no pressure and no rush.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 big cat pictures in 4K</strong> — lions and tigers on golden savannas, in green forests and fresh snow, from a black-maned king to two tigers at play in the snow. Two expansion packs add 16 more pictures each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 to 1,008 pieces</strong> — seven sizes, from a 40-piece coffee break to a 1,008-piece project you can keep coming back to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feels like a real puzzle</strong> — every piece has a real cut shape, depth and shadow. Pieces tumble out of the box, lift when you pick them up and click into place when they fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful tools, only when you want them</strong> — show edge pieces only, sort pieces into piles by colour, shuffle the table, peek at the box lid, lay a faint picture on the board or ask for a hint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotation mode</strong> — turn on rotated pieces for an extra challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your gallery wall</strong> — every finished puzzle is framed, with your best time for each size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A warm, calm table</strong> — gentle piano music and birdsong, leaves drifting down when you finish a puzzle, and four table styles to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up where you left off</strong> — every puzzle saves automatically and syncs with Steam Cloud, so a big puzzle can take as many evenings as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Steam achievements</strong> — from your first finished puzzle to a 1,008-piece Apex Predator, with a few surprises for early risers and night owls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller and Steam Deck support</strong> — play with mouse and keyboard, a controller or on Steam Deck. Also runs on Linux and SteamOS.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour the pieces out of the box, find the corners and watch a tiger in the snow or a black-maned lion on the savanna come together piece by piece. <strong>Big Cat Jigsaw Quest</strong> is a calm, good-looking jigsaw puzzle game about lions and tigers, with no pressure and no rush.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 big cat pictures in 4K</strong> — lions and tigers on golden savannas, in green forests and fresh snow, from a black-maned king to two tigers at play in the snow. Two expansion packs add 16 more pictures each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 to 1,008 pieces</strong> — seven sizes, from a 40-piece coffee break to a 1,008-piece project you can keep coming back to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feels like a real puzzle</strong> — every piece has a real cut shape, depth and shadow. Pieces tumble out of the box, lift when you pick them up and click into place when they fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful tools, only when you want them</strong> — show edge pieces only, sort pieces into piles by colour, shuffle the table, peek at the box lid, lay a faint picture on the board or ask for a hint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotation mode</strong> — turn on rotated pieces for an extra challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your gallery wall</strong> — every finished puzzle is framed, with your best time for each size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A warm, calm table</strong> — gentle piano music and birdsong, leaves drifting down when you finish a puzzle, and four table styles to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up where you left off</strong> — every puzzle saves automatically and syncs with Steam Cloud, so a big puzzle can take as many evenings as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Steam achievements</strong> — from your first finished puzzle to a 1,008-piece Apex Predator, with a few surprises for early risers and night owls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller and Steam Deck support</strong> — play with mouse and keyboard, a controller or on Steam Deck. Also runs on Linux and SteamOS.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A relaxing jigsaw puzzle game with 16 lion and tiger pictures in 4K. Choose 40 to 1,008 pieces, tip the box onto a wooden table, sort pieces by colour and frame every finished puzzle on your gallery wall. Plays with mouse, controller or Steam Deck.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396280/d4c2a32377ab808394b8924dc6b0fd100e1ed501/header.jpg?t=1794044259", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396280/6f57769b377af11b665caf53efd9334a96fe2850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1794044259", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396280/6f57769b377af11b665caf53efd9334a96fe2850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1794044259", "website": "https://dustyrocketgames.com/games/big-cat-jigsaw-quest/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11